<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39691" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικεύθω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>conceal, hide</i>, always with a neg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέω ἔπος οὐδ᾽ ἐπικεύσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.816
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόφρων ὑποθήσομαι οὐδ᾽ ἐπικεύσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.143
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰπέ μοι . . νημερτέα</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδ᾽ ἐπικεύσῃς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.263
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῦθον δέ τοι οὐκ ἐπικεύσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.744
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				17.141
			</span></i>: and in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				800
			</span></i> (anap.), c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ σ᾽
			ἐπικεύσω</span> I <i>will</i> not <i>hide</i> it
			<i>from</i> thee, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.332
			</span></i>.</div>
